{"parentUuid":"24c5bbe8-08f4-47cf-89ce-4703c5cc07ce","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"e8587740-1817-4321-bc7c-520d0eac0a5b","agentId":"a92286cd9de3a8ecc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014nKcq2yN6aawNxeosFb7JX","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"RDNA3 gfx1100 SQ_THREAD_TRACE registers SQTT thread trace configuration MMIO\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"radv: add initial SQ Thread Trace support for GFX9 - mesa/mesa - The Mesa 3D Graphics Library (mirrored from https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa)\",\"url\":\"https://cgit.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/commit/?id=768d4f0551e38bd688e3e551d5276ceff5d2316b\"},{\"title\":\"ROCm Core SDK 10.0.0 release notes — AMD ROCm 10.0.0\",\"url\":\"https://rocm.docs.amd.com/en/latest/about/release-notes.html\"},{\"title\":\"AMD begins RDNA3 (GFX11) graphics architecture enablement for LLVM project - VideoCardz.com\",\"url\":\"https://videocardz.com/newz/amd-begins-rdna3-gfx11-graphics-architecture-enablement-for-llvm-project\"},{\"title\":\"SQ Thread Trace (SQTT) workflow with AQLprofile — AQLprofile 1.0 documentation\",\"url\":\"https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/aqlprofile/en/develop/examples/sqtt-workflow.html\"},{\"title\":\"[Bug]: RCCL RDNA3 gfx1100 Tp2 ROCM at startup · Issue #38587 · vllm-project/vllm\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/38587\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - lhl/fsr4-rdna3-optimization · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/lhl/fsr4-rdna3-optimization\"},{\"title\":\"Examining AMD’s RDNA 4 Changes in LLVM - by Chester Lam\",\"url\":\"https://chipsandcheese.com/p/examining-amds-rdna-4-changes-in-llvm\"},{\"title\":\"RDNA 3\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RDNA_3\"},{\"title\":\"rdna docs - anuraag notes\",\"url\":\"https://anuraagw.me/blog/rdna-docs\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found some relevant information about SQTT (SQ Thread Trace) and RDNA3/gfx1100:\n\nSQTT is a hardware block that collects thread trace data (like wave occupancy, timings, etc) for every draw/dispatch calls.\n\nRegarding the gfx1100 GPU specifically, the RX 7900 XTX target in LLVM is gfx1100, which is an RDNA 3 architecture GPU.\n\nThe search results show that the gfx1100, gfx1102, and gfx1201 (Navi) SystemDBs were refreshed with updated tuned find/perf-database entries in ROCm 10.0.0, and ROCprofiler-SDK introduces an experimental SQTT quick scan mode for thread trace.\n\nHowever, the search results do not contain specific technical details about the SQ_THREAD_TRACE registers, MMIO configuration details, or the specific register definitions for gfx1100. For detailed MMIO register specifications and SQTT configuration information for RDNA3, you would likely need to consult AMD's official hardware documentation, the LLVM or Mesa graphics driver source code repositories, or AMD's GPU documentation for the GFX11 instruction set architecture.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"c60a0cbd-18d0-4fc7-b358-c1a71a874345","timestamp":"2026-09-06T00:24:10.805Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"RDNA3 gfx1100 SQ_THREAD_TRACE registers SQTT thread trace configuration MMIO","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01LcujKQNLSR7Zzs5KQeEcaj","content":[{"title":"radv: add initial SQ Thread Trace support for GFX9 - mesa/mesa - The Mesa 3D Graphics Library (mirrored from https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa)","url":"https://cgit.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/commit/?id=768d4f0551e38bd688e3e551d5276ceff5d2316b"},{"title":"ROCm Core SDK 10.0.0 release notes — AMD ROCm 10.0.0","url":"https://rocm.docs.amd.com/en/latest/about/release-notes.html"},{"title":"AMD begins RDNA3 (GFX11) graphics architecture enablement for LLVM project - VideoCardz.com","url":"https://videocardz.com/newz/amd-begins-rdna3-gfx11-graphics-architecture-enablement-for-llvm-project"},{"title":"SQ Thread Trace (SQTT) workflow with AQLprofile — AQLprofile 1.0 documentation","url":"https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/aqlprofile/en/develop/examples/sqtt-workflow.html"},{"title":"[Bug]: RCCL RDNA3 gfx1100 Tp2 ROCM at startup · Issue #38587 · vllm-project/vllm","url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/38587"},{"title":"GitHub - lhl/fsr4-rdna3-optimization · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/lhl/fsr4-rdna3-optimization"},{"title":"Examining AMD’s RDNA 4 Changes in LLVM - by Chester Lam","url":"https://chipsandcheese.com/p/examining-amds-rdna-4-changes-in-llvm"},{"title":"RDNA 3","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RDNA_3"},{"title":"rdna docs - anuraag notes","url":"https://anuraagw.me/blog/rdna-docs"}]},"Based on the search results, I found some relevant information about SQTT (SQ Thread Trace) and RDNA3/gfx1100:\n\nSQTT is a hardware block that collects thread trace data (like wave occupancy, timings, etc) for every draw/dispatch calls.\n\nRegarding the gfx1100 GPU specifically, the RX 7900 XTX target in LLVM is gfx1100, which is an RDNA 3 architecture GPU.\n\nThe search results show that the gfx1100, gfx1102, and gfx1201 (Navi) SystemDBs were refreshed with updated tuned find/perf-database entries in ROCm 10.0.0, and ROCprofiler-SDK introduces an experimental SQTT quick scan mode for thread trace.\n\nHowever, the search results do not contain specific technical details about the SQ_THREAD_TRACE registers, MMIO configuration details, or the specific register definitions for gfx1100. For detailed MMIO register specifications and SQTT configuration information for RDNA3, you would likely need to consult AMD's official hardware documentation, the LLVM or Mesa graphics driver source code repositories, or AMD's GPU documentation for the GFX11 instruction set architecture."],"durationSeconds":6.393861631999724,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"24c5bbe8-08f4-47cf-89ce-4703c5cc07ce","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/jacob/z/tinygrad","sessionId":"bbbf3962-a9cf-4c32-800a-58c69b1ea8de","version":"2.1.261","gitBranch":"amd-qwen-