{"parentUuid":"09d8d62c-d1ca-4463-9297-bee056984bb6","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"e8587740-1817-4321-bc7c-520d0eac0a5b","agentId":"a92286cd9de3a8ecc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018nch7hKgKJKszsk7PJxzJx","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS client id CID decode table gfx11 amdgpu source\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"[Issue]: ROCm Issue Report - AMDGPU Page Fault Error · Issue #5670 · ROCm/ROCm\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ROCm/ROCm/issues/5670\"},{\"title\":\"ROCm 7.2.1 / 6.17.0-1020-oem ROCm soft-crashes: GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS:0x00000B32 Faulty UTCL2 client ID: CPC (0x5) · Issue #6269 · ROCm/ROCm\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/rocm/rocm/issues/6269\"},{\"title\":\"[SOLVED] amdgpu rocm GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS in linux-firmware / Kernel & Hardware / Arch Linux Forums\",\"url\":\"https://bbs.archlinux.org/viewtopic.php?id=310497\"},{\"title\":\"page fault GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS on 7900xtx Linux 6.7-rc1 with Mesa 23.3.0-rc3\",\"url\":\"https://www.mail-archive.com/amd-gfx@lists.freedesktop.org/msg99806.html\"},{\"title\":\"[Issue]: amdgpu pagefault under rocm7.2 on gfx1151 · Issue #5890 · ROCm/ROCm\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ROCm/ROCm/issues/5890\"},{\"title\":\"[SOLVED] AMD GPU crashing / Kernel & Hardware / Arch Linux Forums\",\"url\":\"https://bbs.archlinux.org/viewtopic.php?id=299954\"},{\"title\":\"[Issue]: GPU page fault on gfx1151 (Radeon 8060S) — basic tensor operations hang · Issue #5991 · ROCm/ROCm\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ROCm/ROCm/issues/5991\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about the GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS register and its client ID decoding for AMD GPUs.\n\nThe search results show multiple examples of GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS errors with decoded client IDs. For example, one fault shows CPC (Compute Pipe Controller - 0x5), while another shows SDMA1 (0xe), and another shows SQC (data) (0xa).\n\nThe results include error logs from gfx11 architecture GPUs (gfx1101, gfx1151) showing the GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS register values and their decoded client ID information. However, the search results don't contain a comprehensive decode table that directly maps all CID values to their client names for gfx11.\n\nFor a complete decode table specific to gfx11 amdgpu source code, you may need to consult:\n- The Linux kernel amdgpu driver source code repository (specifically files in drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/ or drivers/gpu/drm/amd/include/)\n- AMD's documentation or hardware manuals for RDNA 2+ GPU architecture\n- The ROCm source code repository on GitHub\n\nThe search results demonstrate that the client IDs can vary by GPU architecture generation, so a gfx11-specific decode table would be the most relevant reference for your needs.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"c0890f2c-6e4a-4f4f-8d15-2d15cbcdab61","timestamp":"2026-09-06T00:24:50.560Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS client id CID decode table gfx11 amdgpu source","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Xa7eseXchqNuAF67L6njBp","content":[{"title":"[Issue]: ROCm Issue Report - AMDGPU Page Fault Error · Issue #5670 · ROCm/ROCm","url":"https://github.com/ROCm/ROCm/issues/5670"},{"title":"ROCm 7.2.1 / 6.17.0-1020-oem ROCm soft-crashes: GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS:0x00000B32 Faulty UTCL2 client ID: CPC (0x5) · Issue #6269 · ROCm/ROCm","url":"https://github.com/rocm/rocm/issues/6269"},{"title":"[SOLVED] amdgpu rocm GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS in linux-firmware / Kernel & Hardware / Arch Linux Forums","url":"https://bbs.archlinux.org/viewtopic.php?id=310497"},{"title":"page fault GCVM_L2_PROTECTION_FAULT_STATUS on 7900xtx Linux 6.7-rc1 with Mesa 23.3.0-rc3","url":"https://www.mail-archive.com/amd-gfx@lists.freedesktop.org/msg99806.html"},{"title":"[Issue]: amdgpu pagefault u